  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[Dmaj7]I couldn't resist him [C#maj7]\n[Cmaj7]His eyes were like yours [C#maj7]His\n[Dmaj7]hair was exactly the shade of\n[F#m7b5]brown [B7#5]\n[Em7]He's just not as tall\n[Gm7b5]But I couldn't tell\n[Dmaj7]It was dark and I was lying\ndown\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dmaj7]You are everything [C#maj7]He\n[Cmaj7]means nothing to me [C#maj7]\n[Dmaj7]I can't even remember his\n[F#m7b5]name [B7#5]\n[Em7]Why're you so upset?\n[Gm7b5]Baby, you weren't there And\n[Dmaj7]I was thinking of you when I\n[G/A]came [A13]\n\n[Bridge]\n[F#m7]What do you expect?\n[B9]You left me here\n[E9]alone\n[A13]I drank so much and needed your touch\n[F#m7]Don't overreact,\n[B9]I pretended he\n[E9]was you You\n[A13]wouldn't want me to be lonely\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Dmaj7]How can I put it so [C#maj7]you un-\n[Cmaj7]derstand? [C#maj7]\n[Dmaj7]I didn't let him hold my hand\n[F#m7b5][B7#5]But he\n[Em7]looked like you I guess he\n[Gm7b5]looked like you\n[Dmaj7]No,\n[F#m7b5]he wasn't [B7#5]you But\n[Em7]you can still trust me,\n[Gm7b5]this ain't infidelity\n[Dmaj7]It's not cheating, you were on\n[F#m7b5]my mind [B7#5]Yes,\n\n[Outro]\n[Em7]he looked like you But\n[D/E]I [E9]heard [Em9]love [A13]is\n[Dmaj7]blind",
